NAME
    svc - inspect and control SCFG services

SYNOPSIS
    svc [list]
    svc status [NAME]
    svc start NAME
    svc stop NAME
    svc restart NAME
    svc log NAME

DESCRIPTION
    Controls the bounded service supervisor using stable SCFG names. Services
    remain foreground KEX processes under direct supervision; they do not
    daemonize or use PID files. stop and restart preserve exact task ownership,
    while log copies bounded recent service output.
